      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Multiple saved logins already exists via the `--profile` launch option https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/launch-options\nJust create a shortcut, name it accordingly, and add `--profile=1`, and that will save the login for that profile. Then just add on the number for more. Do note that some settings in-game is global.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
