  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-08-12T01:16:50.650Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Give the desktop screen a regular 2D login page while the login menu is up in VR. My username and password are painstakingly long and the copy paste method is pretty annoying in VR mode to log in. I would rather just log in using desktop screen then put my headset on.\nI switch between a few accounts often for events and activities so I log in and out on a regular basis. Changing the login screen would be a wonderful thing for people like me. Maybe even allow multiple saved login names and simply choose which?",
